    "title": "Which South SF Bay area high school alumni will be active during the week beginning Monday, Oct. 6? - South SF Bay News",
    "text": "During the week beginning Monday, Oct. 6, these former South SF Bay area high school athletes will be in action.\nAustin Jennings\nLake Erie Storm\nSophomore\n6′4″ 235\nLive Oak High School\nNext Game: vs. Northwood Timberwolves, Saturday, Oct. 11, 12 p.m.\nCaleb Ojeda\nOregon State Beavers\n5′9″ 186\nLive Oak High School\nHometown: Morgan Hill\nNext Game: vs. Wake Forest Demon Deacons, Saturday, Oct. 11, 12:30 p.m.\nDomanick DeLeon-Catano\nMayville State Comets\nJunior\n5′11″ 190\nGilroy High School\nHometown: Morgan Hill\nNext Game: vs. Valley City State Vikings, Saturday, Oct. 11, 1 p.m.\nJonathan Cruz\nSouthern Oregon Raiders\nFreshman\n5′11″ 165\nAnn Sobrato High School\nHometown: San Jose\nNext Game: vs. Simpson Red Hawks, Saturday, Oct. 11, 7 p.m.\nNick Fernandez\nPuget Sound Loggers\nSenior\n5′11″ 190\nAnn Sobrato High School\nHometown: San Pedro\nNext Game: vs. Pacific Lutheran Lutes, Saturday, Oct. 11, 1 p.m.\nTyler Pacheco\nChapman Panthers\nSenior\n6′2″ 205\nSan Benito High School\nHometown: Hollister\nNext Game: vs. Pomona-Pitzer Sagehens, Saturday, Oct. 11, 7 p.m.",
